.Dt POCKETPARSE 1
.Os tinyactors
.Sh NAME
.Nm pocketparse
.Nd compile grammar data into running parsers at runtime
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm check
.Ar GRAMMAR
.Nm
.Cm run
.Ar GRAMMAR
.Fl \-input
